{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game synopsis:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious program called \u201cCupid\u2019s Chatroom\u201d suddenly appears on your PC, transporting you into a private chatroom. You find yourself joined by five others, who have also been dragged into the server\u2014and it turns out they\u2019re your potential bachelors?! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet the bachelors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157200/extras/steam_roman_profile.png?t=1746288404\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157200/extras/steam_daeho_profile.png?t=1746288404\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157200/extras/steam_ivan_profile.png?t=1746288404\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157200/extras/steam_joseph_profile.png?t=1746288404\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157200/extras/steam_oliver_profile.png?t=1746288404\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content warning:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cupid's Chatroom is an 18+ dating chatsim. The full game contains NSFW content that is only intended for players 18 years and older. The demo is SFW.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Other warnings:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mentions of violence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Topics on trauma, depression, and other mental illnesses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strong language, cursing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 love interests to get to know until Day 3.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~20k words for each route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pronoun options and customizable username. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Video and voice calls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Receive selfies from the LIs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Partial voice acting.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of banter. Like a lot.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Thank you!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for playing the demo of Cupid's Chatroom. We're planning to launch a Kickstarter to help fund the full development of the game. Follow the studio on Tumblr, Twitter, and Bluesky for updates on the game's development \u2661</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3157200?t=1746288404","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746288404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157200/efb22998f1ae5a340be0cd0be6b250e441ab8a62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746288404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157200/efb22998f1ae5a340be0cd0be6b250e441ab8a62/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746288404","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The demo of Cupid's Chatroom contains sexual language used in a joking manner. "},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game synopsis:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious program called \u201cCupid\u2019s Chatroom\u201d suddenly appears on your PC, transporting you into a private chatroom. You find yourself joined by five others, who have also been dragged into the server\u2014and it turns out they\u2019re your potential bachelors?! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet the bachelors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/